ia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The pendulum draws the eye.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye..png/revision/latest?cb=20210211202927\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The pendulum draws the eye.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202927\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202927 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d4/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210211202927 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The pendulum draws the eye.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_pendulum_draws_the_eye..png\" data-image-name=\"The pendulum draws the eye..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">7</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\">Kerry Godliman</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mother_honks_her_horn.\" title=\"Mother honks her horn.\">Mother honks her horn.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/I_can_hear_it_gooping.\" title=\"I can hear it gooping.\">I can hear it gooping.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The pendulum draws the eye.</b></i> is the ninth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">Series 7</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 31 October 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\">Kerry Godliman</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"The pendulum draws the eye\" was a phrased used by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> to describe <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\">Phil Wang</a>'s hypnotic crotch bulge in the <a href=\"/wiki/Hula\" title=\"Hula\">Hula</a> task. The title card shows \"<a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">TM</a>\" written with towers of coins. The coins come from the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_money_in_the_small_bowl\" title=\"Put the most money in the small bowl\">Put the most money in the small bowl</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Man bemærker kun pendulet', which translates as 'All you notice is the pendulum'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Heiluri vetää katseen itseensä', which translates as 'The pendulum draws the eye'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pendelen tiltrekker seg oppmerksomhet', which translates as 'The pendant attracts attention'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">James Acaster</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Knappett\" title=\"Jessica Knappett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jessica Knappett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kerry Godliman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Wang</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rhod Gilbert</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_surprisingly_beautiful_thing\" title=\"Most surprisingly beautiful thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most surprisingly beautiful thing.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_money_in_the_small_bowl\" title=\"Put the most money in the small bowl\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put the most money in the small bowl. You may not touch the small bowl. The small bowl must not sink. Also, you must say your own name at least once every 30 seconds.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed #ddd;\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Be_photographed_in_the_most_unusual_situation_wearing_this_fez\" title=\"Be photographed in the most unusual situation wearing this fez\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Be photographed in the most unusual situation wearing this fez.\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hula\" title=\"Hula\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Hula.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>2</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">–\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">–\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Improve your hulaing.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_sock_with_a_satsuma_inside\" title=\"Find the sock with a satsuma inside\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Find the sock with a satsuma inside. You may not look inside any of the socks. You may squeeze 5 socks, strike 10 socks and sniff 20 socks. You may put your hand inside 3 socks. You may put 11 socks on your feet.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achieve_a_rally_of_exactly_24_shots\" title=\"Achieve a rally of exactly 24 shots\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Achieve a rally of exactly 24 shots. You must each take the same amount of shots. You must be stood at least 6 foot 8 inches apart from one another. The object struck may neither touch the ground nor be held at any point during the rally.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Most ambitious equipment.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Write_your_name_and_draw_a_picture_of_a_happy_horse\" title=\"Write your name and draw a picture of a happy horse\">7</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Write your name and draw a happy horse on your overhead projector acetate upside down. You must not rotate or manipulate acetate.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the only episode of the UK version of the show to have an episode with 7 tasks, though not every task was undergone by every contestant.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" type